00:55:09.869 --> 00:55:13.369
And, you know, which...

00:55:13.369 --> 00:55:15.380
Well, I won't say anything about...

00:55:15.380 --> 00:55:16.380
Yeah, I will.

00:55:16.380 --> 00:55:17.380
It's absurd.

00:55:17.380 --> 00:55:23.970
It's absurd to assume that that's how human
