00:56:36.089 --> 00:56:37.730
Jordan: Well, that's the question.

00:56:37.730 --> 00:56:39.900
Well, okay, so then I would say, well, it's
interesting.

00:56:39.900 --> 00:56:45.329
Because I think that a lot of this confusion
has emerged fundamentally as a consequence

00:56:45.329 --> 00:56:47.039
