00:58:00.980 --> 00:58:02.960
Jordan: Well, and I'm not making a case for
the abolition of the birth control pill, by

00:58:02.960 --> 00:58:04.320
any stretch of the imagination.

00:58:04.320 --> 00:58:06.079
But I'm pointing at its complexity.

00:58:06.079 --> 00:58:12.079
And so, because one of the questions is well,
once you can regulate your reproductive function,

00:58:12.079 --> 00:58:15.700
what attitude should you have towards sex?

00:58:15.700 --> 00:58:21.390
And one answer might be the more of it under
the more varied circumstances the better,

00:58:21.390 --> 00:58:22.860
because why not?

00:58:22.860 --> 00:58:27.330
And I would say that was actually part of
the attitude that emerged in the aftermath

00:58:27.330 --> 00:58:30.060
of the birth control pill in the 1960s, right?

00:58:30.060 --> 00:58:35.430
And it was a reasonable response, in some
sense, because it's such a cataclysmic change

00:58:35.430 --> 00:58:37.790
that you don't know what it implies.

00:58:37.790 --> 00:58:40.230
Well, what's the consequence of that?

00:58:40.230 --> 00:58:45.630
Well, first of all, people aren't reliable
enough to use birth control in an entirely

00:58:45.630 --> 00:58:47.030
reliable manner.

00:58:47.030 --> 00:58:52.359
So even though it can work at near 100% efficiency,
you have to take it extraordinarily regularly

00:58:52.359 --> 00:58:54.800
and in a disciplined manner for that to work.

00:58:54.800 --> 00:59:00.470
And so there was still the problem of unwanted
pregnancy, let's say.

00:59:00.470 --> 00:59:06.780
And then there was the problem of the proliferation
of sexual epidemics, and that culminated in

00:59:06.780 --> 00:59:10.080
AIDS, which, you know, could have easily wiped
all of us out, but didn't.

00:59:10.080 --> 00:59:14.329
But there's other sexual epidemics that could
have had the same effect, but we've been fortunate

00:59:14.329 --> 00:59:17.390
enough to escape them.

00:59:17.390 --> 00:59:24.200
And then more recently, there's been this
weird inversion, especially on the radical

00:59:24.200 --> 00:59:30.839
