beyond belief to hold that as a core proposition,

00:59:50.589 --> 00:59:57.250
because it forces you to, first of all, if
it's repetitive sex with multiple partners,

00:59:57.250 --> 01:00:01.210
it forces you to treat people as if they're
interchangeable.

01:00:01.210 --> 01:00:08.569
And I don't see how that's good for you psychologically,
or for the people that you're using interchangeably.

01:00:08.569 --> 01:00:16.800
It implies that you can divorce sexuality
from play, from the desire for a relationship,

01:00:16.800 --> 01:00:22.859
from emotional fragility, from love, from
family, from responsibility.

01:00:22.859 --> 01:00:25.190
All of those things that are part and parcel
of everyone.

01:00:25.190 --> 01:00:31.069
And I don't think you can, and I don't think
people's experience indicates that you can,

01:00:31.069 --> 01:00:32.980
especially on the emotional front.

01:00:32.980 --> 01:00:38.050
And I think that's partly what's driving,
and there's also a residual sense that there's

01:00:38.050 --> 01:00:40.770
